stal accents, pleated silk.. Keep existing bathtub/shower/sink/toilet at same position, size, shape. Do not duplicate any fixture already visible. Compact by default: ONE vanity 60cm, ONE basin, no freestanding tub. Only 80cm vanity or freestanding tub if room clearly >2.5m wide. 80cm shower max if compact. Do not widen or deepen the room. 60cm min passage width. Contact shadows on every piece. DSLR wide-angle, sharp focus, deep DOF. Same focal length as input. No text. Freestanding objects only — place furniture INSIDE the room only, not on terraces or balconies visible through windows."`;

