le. If — and only if — the input shows a visible island or peninsula with no pendant light above it, add one or two pendant lights 30-40cm matching the style — otherwise the ceiling light from pass 1 stays as the only overhead fixture. Functional and organized atmosphere — counters kept mostly clear, no clutter, no armchairs, no lounge chairs, no floor lamps, no area rug on the work zone. Design style: mediterranean. Materials and palette: White lime plaster, natural linen in off-white, olive wood, wrought iron with aged patina, terracotta and turquoise glazed ceramics, esparto grass.. Cabinetry against walls. Island only if >10m2. Ceiling light from pass 1 — keep as-is. Scale to apparent width. Distribute kitchen elements across the full depth. Work zones along walls, island in middle if >10m2. Counter accessories spread across full counter length. Include 2-3 lived-in details: cutting board, fruit bowl, folded tea towel. Luxury listing photo. Contact shadows on every piece. DSLR wide-angle, sharp focus, deep DOF. Same focal length as input. No text. Freestanding objects only — place furniture INSIDE the room only, not on terraces or balconies visible through windows."`;

